132
00:10:23,256 --> 00:10:25,109
Thank you, everybody!

133
00:10:25,110 --> 00:10:26,893
Thank you so much.

134
00:10:26,894 --> 00:10:31,364
And welcome
to the first ever Grand Tour.

135
00:10:35,602 --> 00:10:40,538
Thank you. Now, we hope
you like our tent.

136
00:10:40,573 --> 00:10:44,144
We think the great thing is that
because it roams around the world,

137
00:10:44,179 --> 00:10:47,715
