in sport mode,

926
00:54:26,366 --> 00:54:27,664
so that the rear end squats

927
00:54:27,665 --> 00:54:29,633
when I set off
and gives me more traction.

928
00:54:29,634 --> 00:54:32,835
I have to have the DRS
button pressed with my thumb

929
00:54:32,870 --> 00:54:36,423
