which reduces drag obviously.

930
00:54:36,458 --> 00:54:39,977
Launch control in the Porsche,
left foot on the brake hard.

931
00:54:40,012 --> 00:54:41,977
Right foot
on the throttle hard.

932
00:54:42,012 --> 00:54:44,349
Light goes green, left foot
off brake. Pa-ching!

933
00:54:44,384 --> 00:54:46,716
Launch button,
press for two seconds.

934
00:54:46,751 --> 00:54:49,353
Left foot on brake.
Right foot on throttle.

935
00:54:49,388 --> 00:54:52,073
Press launch control,
mash the throttle,

936
00:54:52,108 --> 00:54:55,051
