946
00:55:39,169 --> 00:55:41,939
Oh, my God!
That is quick!

947
00:55:45,810 --> 00:55:49,496
Holy mother!
Did you see that?

948
00:55:49,531 --> 00:55:53,183
[BLEEP] me!
Jesus [BLEEP] Christ!

