No, no!

976
00:57:44,729 --> 00:57:46,997
Okay, we have all three
won this now.

977
00:57:49,634 --> 00:57:51,902
JEREMY: Determined
to find a definitive

978
00:57:51,937 --> 00:57:55,405
one-two-three
finishing order,

979
00:57:55,440 --> 00:57:57,308
